---
import Experience from '../layouts/Experience.astro';
import { orgs } from '../data/profile';
---

<Experience org={orgs.vanguard}>
  <p>
    My time at Vanguard was a focused six-month chapter between my two runs at
    Foundations IT. The work centered on <strong>observability</strong>: making
    it easier to see what software was actually doing in production.
  </p>

  <p>
    I built <strong>Splunk</strong> dashboards that visualized the impact of a large
    modernization effort, and I integrated <strong>Honeycomb</strong> logging across
    projects to sharpen how quickly teams could spot and understand errors. I also
    earned the <strong>AWS Cloud Practitioner</strong> certification during this stretch.
  </p>
</Experience>
